cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Operator-Spectral Truncated Priors for Query-Efficient QAOA Parameter Search"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and deterministic artifact regenerator for the
  OST-QAOA manuscript. OST-QAOA constructs noncommutative operator-spectral
  truncated priors over QAOA angles for query-efficient parameter search on
  MaxCut, evaluated with exact statevector simulation across four synthetic
  graph families. This package is part of the author's "spectral-truncation
  operators" program.
type: software
